{"name":"Figurine","hex":"#e4d5c0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"figurine","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small carved or molded figure; a statuette."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/figurine"}],"entries":[{"title":"Figurine","blocks":[{"text":"A figurine or statuette is a small, three-dimensional sculpture that represents a human, deity or animal, or, in practice, a pair or small group of them. Figurines have been made in many media, with clay, metal, wood, glass, and today plastic or resin the most significant. Ceramic figurines not made of porcelain are called terracottas in historical contexts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Status_of_Kuan_Yin.jpg/330px-Status_of_Kuan_Yin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Figurine"},{"title":"Figurine (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Figurine is an American electronic music group. The band members, friends since high school, use the pseudonyms David Figurine, James Figurine and Meredith Figurine."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Dntel.jpg/330px-Dntel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Figurine_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Venus_von_Willendorf_01.jpg/500px-Venus_von_Willendorf_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Venus_von_Willendorf_01.jpg/1280px-Venus_von_Willendorf_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Venus_von_Willendorf_01.jpg/500px-Venus_von_Willendorf_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Prehistoric Venus of Willendorf figurine","link":"h